George (Supporter): Hello there.

- What is your opinion of Christopher Columbus?
	
	George (Supporter): To me, his knowledge of the seas makes him a great man.
	George (Supporter): He crossed an ocean and found this wonderful land for us and our country.
	George (Supporter): The skill it takes to do that... it is almost unimaginable.
	George (Supporter): He was denied for years, but he had the ambition to secure the funding and execute this project as skillfully as he did.
	George (Supporter): The respect I have for him is very high.
	=> start
	
- Goodbye
	George (Supporter): Have a good day.
	=> END
